00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.960
Glad to see that we--

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:45.820
Google Cloud and a lot
of our health partners

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:47.560
are actually
fulfilling something

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:49.380
that really means a lot to you.

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:51.250
DAN SKAGGS: Yeah, they
had one stat where--

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:54.115
was it the Human Genome
Project took a billion dollars

00:04:54.115 --> 00:04:55.630
in 10 years?

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.670
And then that was
in, I think, 2003.

00:04:57.670 --> 00:05:00.970
By 2010, I believe, if I
remember the numbers correctly,

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:04.160
it took $10 million and months.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:07.810
And so the advent of these
machine learning ecosystems

00:05:07.810 --> 00:05:10.990
and the big data and
stuff to be able to squash

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:14.890
that time and the cost has
to be nothing but beneficial

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:17.120
for people that are
researching cures

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:20.210
for diseases and conditions
that we are experiencing now.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:21.857
So it's just amazing.

00:05:21.857 --> 00:05:23.440
MARK MANDEL: It's
just exciting stuff.

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:24.160
