00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:18.410
It ended up being almost a
three page document, where

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:21.980
we were talking about, what is
a specific thing that a data

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:24.950
engineer will get out of
it versus a data scientist?

00:07:24.950 --> 00:07:27.392
