00:07:32.375 --> 00:07:34.652
So yeah, it's a diverse group.

00:07:34.652 --> 00:07:36.110
AJA HAMMERLY: It
is a diverse group

00:07:36.110 --> 00:07:37.430
and all sorts of backgrounds.

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:39.388
We've got folks who've
been doing this forever.

00:07:39.388 --> 00:07:42.320
We've got folks who have
very tight ties to operator.

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:44.000
We've got folks more
like myself, who

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.010
kind of dabble in everything.

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:49.490
And we have approximate
knowledge of many things.

00:07:49.490 --> 00:07:51.800
And we've got folks
who specifically

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:54.680
